# ⛔ ALLOWLIST, for the same reason memo-audit uses one, plus a sharper one:
# everything this directory GENERATES is verbatim Slack content from Ben's
# private channels — health, finance, insurance, house-reno. Digests, worker
# records and checkpoints must never reach a remote. They all regenerate from
# the archive, so there is nothing to preserve and everything to leak.
*
!.gitignore
!archive.py
!verify.py
!mine.py
!mine-run.py
!mine-prompt.md
!README.md
